# SwiftDrop frontend environment (Vite)
#
# IMPORTANT: every VITE_-prefixed variable is embedded PUBLICLY into the browser
# bundle. Never put secrets here (JWT secrets, DATABASE_URL, API keys, tokens,
# Idempotency-Key values). Only public configuration belongs in this file.

# Root URL of the SwiftDrop backend API (see server/.env PORT, default 3000).
#
#   http://localhost:3000/api/v1  -> talk to the backend directly. The backend
#     has no CORS middleware yet, so browser cross-origin requests with
#     credentials will fail; use this for Node tooling/tests or once CORS is on.
#
#   /api/v1                       -> route through the Vite dev proxy
#     (vite.config.ts). Same-origin, the HttpOnly refresh cookie works, no CORS
#     needed. Recommended for browser development.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000/api/v1
